{"articleNo":"707","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=707&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"*제10기 홍보도우미 모집* 기간 연장","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.03.19","hit":"14110","attachments":[{"name":"홍보도우미_지원서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=707&attachNo=69422"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"HStyle0\" align=\"center\"><strong><font size=\"4\"></font></strong>&nbsp;</p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" align=\"center\"><strong><font size=\"4\">[제10기 홍보도우미 모집]</font></strong><br></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><br></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><br></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;&nbsp;우리대학 홍보의식 고취 및 홍보마인드 확산과 방문객들에 대한 친절, 봉사 이미지 제고에 </p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\">힘쓸 2009학년도 [제10기 홍보도우미]를 다음과 같이 모집합니다. </p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><br></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;&nbsp;진취적이고, 도전적인 신입생 여러분들의 많은 관심과 참여 부탁드립니다.</p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" align=\"center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>- 다&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 음 - </strong><br></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><br></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▶지원자격 : 용모단정한 <font color=\"#ff1493\">2009학년도 신입생</font>에 한함</p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(*선발 후 1년간 휴학하지 아니할 자)</p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▶선발인원 : 7명(남.녀 구분없음)</p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▶기&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 간 : <font color=\"#ff1493\">2009년 3월 9(월)~23(월) 18시까지</font><br></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▶제출서류 :&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">◦</span>홍보도우미 지원서 1부. </p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">◦</span></span>자기소개서 1부(A4). </p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">◦<font face=\"굴림\" color=\"#ff1493\" size=\"2\">반</font></span><font color=\"#ff1493\">명반함판 사진 2매.</font> </p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▶전&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 형 : <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">◦</span>1차 서류 심사</p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">◦</span>2차 면접 심사</p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▶제 출 처&nbsp; : 홍보도우미실 (글로벌관 570호)</p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><br></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;기획협력과 대외협력홍보팀(글로벌관 552호)</p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><br></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▶문 의 처&nbsp; : 홍보도우미실 (478-7083)</p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><br></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;기획협력과 (478-7079)</p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" align=\"center\"><strong><font size=\"4\">금오공과대학교 기획협력과장</font></strong></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><font color=\"#1e90ff\">※파일첨부 : 홍보도우미 지원서 및 선발안내 1부. </font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><font color=\"#1e90ff\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (다운받아 양면(상하열기)으로 인쇄하여 제출하여 주시기 바랍니다.)</font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><font color=\"#1e90ff\"></font>&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
